      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1766987359868,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "clk和I同时变换，会导致图像难以理解,\n真实的图像应该是clk来临前，I已经稳定，\n这个图像无法反映出来",
      "fontSize": 10.491196906254894,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "clk和I同时变换，会导致图像难以理解,\n真实的图像应该是clk来临前，I已经稳定，\n这个图像无法反映出来",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.2
    },
    {
      "id": "fxaj2-VdjIw_Wf0KAH5Wo",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1295.8921137757432,
      "y": -1522.429535958824,
      "width": 142.53274546857236,
      "height": 37.768308862517614,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "#ff8787",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
